# One line-ending policy across the stack, applied to the blobs as well as
# declared (ATLAS-GITATTRIBUTES-DRIFT). LF on every platform so Windows and
# Linux agents produce identical blobs and CRLF-replacement warnings vanish.
#
# Hephaestus's committed blobs are already 100% LF (676 text files), so this
# is declarative: it pins the policy so the next agent check-in cannot regress
# it. No renormalization was needed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Compiled Python extension modules — binary, never normalized.
*.pyd binary